   - any other `error`, or `aborted` without an abort mark: append the error
     entry, settle the inputs `unanswered` with `model_error`, remove `run` and
     `generation`, and fail.
+  - Before the commit of either of the last two cases, and of an interrupted
+    request or poll (above), the `beforeRetry` hooks are asked with the failed
+    attempt and the policy's decision (`delayMs`, absent when it would fail).
+    The first decision wins: `{ retry: true, delayMs? }` sleeps at `retry` until
